Upstream-Name: surface-pro-9-linux
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/joonhoekim/surface-pro-9-linux/issues
Source: https://github.com/joonhoekim/surface-pro-9-linux
Comment:
 The source tarball is made by packaging/source-tarball.sh: the git tree plus
 the Rust crates the helper builds with, vendored in helper/vendor. Each
 vendored crate carries its own licence in its directory (Cargo.toml and the
 licence files it ships); they are linked statically into sp9-helperd,
 sp9-ctl, sp9-settings and sp9-digitizerd. REUSE.toml in the source is the
 authoritative licence map of the project's own files.

